Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.82,0:00:02.19,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,And that's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.48,0:00:06.04,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,We need to hit a million channel \Nsubscribers in six months!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.04,0:00:07.88,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,If we don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.88,0:00:11.06,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,Mayonaka Punch will be breaking up!
