Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.49,0:00:15.53,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord3\fs40\fnComic Sans MS\c&HA54EEB&\3c&HF9FAF5&\pos(320,95)\t(774,1274,\alpha&H99&)}We're Breaking Up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.20,0:00:15.53,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,That's way too slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.53,0:00:17.55,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,It felt like time had stopped!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.55,0:00:21.29,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I've told you over and over that \Ntiming is everything for captions!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.60,0:00:22.79,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Yes, Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.79,0:00:25.48,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Not to mention, this font \Nlooks way too friendly!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.79,0:00:29.55,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord3\fay0.08\fax0.05\fs12\fnComic Sans MS\c&HA54EEB&\3c&HA54EEB&\pos(143,66.5)}We're Breaking Up
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.79,0:00:29.55,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord1.5\fay0.08\fax0.05\fs12\fnComic Sans MS\c&HA54EEB&\3c&HF9FAF5&\pos(143,66.5)}We're Breaking Up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.48,0:00:28.57,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,It's a bleak topic, so make sure \Nthe text reflects that!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.57,0:00:29.55,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Do you understand?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.09,0:00:32.05,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Yes! I'll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.55,0:00:39.23,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,It really {\i0}does{\i1} look bleak, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.56,0:00:41.81,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs20\c&H696B6B&\pos(306,140.5)\bord2\3c&HF7FAF8&}Mayonaka Punch
