Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.56,0:00:41.81,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fs16\c&HDF3498&\pos(318.5,300)\3c&HF2CBE1&}Subscribed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.88,0:00:41.81,DefaultItalicsTop,Masaki,0,0,0,,I need to figure something out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.46,0:00:46.31,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.93,0:00:49.85,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Wh-What did they just say to each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.85,0:00:52.69,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,How can these two be so...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.93,0:00:55.11,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Adorbs?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.42,0:00:57.30,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Fu?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.26,0:01:04.73,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Th-That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.45,0:01:09.20,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,But... it's okay, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.73,0:01:13.05,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,My very first time can be with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.14,0:01:25.14,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs18\c&H444745&\frz13.19\fax0.1\pos(129,106)}[Prank] We Renovated Our Friend's Bathtub\N\hInto a Baby Bath! [DIY]
