Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.14,0:01:25.14,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fs12\c&HF9FDFA&\frz13.19\fax0.1\3c&HF25DEB&\pos(259.5,177)}3.74m subscribers
