Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.27,0:01:26.98,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs30\bord4\c&HE831A7&\3c&HF6D9EB&\frz16.76\pos(311,33.5)}Subscribed
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.03,0:03:04.66,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2.5\fnComic Sans MS\c&H2A3031&\3c&HDCE0E0&}3 Strategies to Hit 1 Million Subs in 6 Months!!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.56,0:02:59.76,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Just so you all understand...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.76,0:03:04.66,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,A million subs in six months won't happen \Nwithout anything short of a miracle!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.01,0:03:09.41,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Even the famous TSUMA-shi \Ntook three years to hit one million!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.41,0:03:10.93,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Th-Three years?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.93,0:03:13.84,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,So six months is definitely impossible, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.84,0:03:14.76,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.76,0:03:18.30,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Not to mention that MayoPan \Ncurrently has just over 40k subs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.58,0:03:21.05,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Normal methods won't get us anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.33,0:03:24.46,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Which is why I've devised \Na three-step strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.93,0:03:29.31,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(233,1)\bord2.5\fnComic Sans MS\c&H2A3031&\3c&HDCE0E0&}3 Strategies to Hit 1 Million Subs in 6 Months!!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.71,0:03:29.31,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,First, step one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.56,0:03:32.42,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Uploading a slew of short videos every day!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.42,0:03:35.81,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,We'll hook new people in \Nwith shorts tuned to the algorithm!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.81,0:03:37.98,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Remember the Chu-Chu Girls' days?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.98,0:03:41.52,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Just like back then, \Nwe'll play the numbers game!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.07,0:03:44.07,Signs_EpTitle,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,1014)\3c&H464848&}Your Faves Are Adorbs, Hit That Subscribe
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.08,0:03:49.32,Default,Live,0,0,0,,You were right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.08,0:03:51.33,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs10\c&H7C7F7D&\move(20,25,-200,25)}A Nocturnal Girl Does\NRadio Calisthenics {\c&HEEF1EE&\3c&HDA75D9&\bord2}100k views
