Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.08,0:03:51.33,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs10\c&H7C7F7D&\move(287.5,25,67.5,25)}A Nocturnal Girl Saves a Farmer With\NHigh-Speed Rice Planting {\c&HEEF1EE&\3c&HDA75D9&\bord2}69k views
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.08,0:03:51.33,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs10\c&H7C7F7D&\move(453,25,233,25)}A Nocturnal Girl Drowns\Nin Pork Fat {\c&HEEF1EE&\3c&HDA75D9&\bord2}91k views
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.08,0:03:51.33,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs10\c&H7C7F7D&\move(562.5,25,342.5,25)}Nocturnal Girls, Awaken Your Senses!\NBlindfolded Musical Chairs... {\c&HEEF1EE&\3c&HDA75D9&\bord2}97k views
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.08,0:03:51.33,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs10\c&H7C7F7D&\move(734.5,25,514.5,25)}Nocturnal Girls Find Paradise\Nin Their Backyard! {\c&HEEF1EE&\3c&HDA75D9&\bord2}120k views
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.32,0:03:51.33,Default,Live,0,0,0,,They're getting more views \Nthan our usual videos!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.52,0:03:55.10,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I'm off to the shopping district \Nto brag about this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.10,0:03:55.71,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Zoom-zoom!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.71,0:03:56.48,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.48,0:03:59.13,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Those old bats at the cashout counter \Nwon't hear the end of it! Vroom, vroom!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.13,0:04:00.17,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.17,0:04:01.55,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.55,0:04:04.64,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H4A4D4A&\pos(168.5,43)}Mayonaka Punch
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.55,0:04:04.64,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fs20\c&HF9EAEF&\3c&HCF52D5&\pos(327,144.5)}50k subscribers
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.73,0:04:04.64,Default,Live,0,0,0,,50k subscribers...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.64,0:04:07.07,Default,Live,0,0,0,,It feels like it's gone up a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.64,0:04:10.52,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,It's nothing considering all the views we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.04,0:04:13.64,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,So time for step two of my strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.64,0:04:23.03,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2.5\fnComic Sans MS\c&H2A3031&\3c&HDCE0E0&}3 Strategies to Hit 1 Million Subs in 6 Months!!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.01,0:04:17.26,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Make them fall in love with \Nthe channel and subscribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.26,0:04:19.48,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Once the shorts have gained traction,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.48,0:04:23.03,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,we want to capitalize on that and have as many\Npeople subscribe to the channel as we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.03,0:04:25.16,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,But that's harder than you'd think!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.41,0:04:26.82,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Huh? Why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.82,0:04:31.29,Default,Live,0,0,0,,You subscribe with the click of a button, \Njust like playing a video, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.29,0:04:32.88,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,The {\i1}click{\i0} of a button!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.88,0:04:36.04,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Getting people to take that \None step is no mean feat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.38,0:04:40.18,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,For example, you can rack up hits \Nwith clickbait thumbnails,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.18,0:04:43.92,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,but if the video doesn't live up \Nto the hype, people won't subscribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.29,0:04:45.31,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,In other words...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.34,0:04:47.98,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,"I love this channel!"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.98,0:04:52.28,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Unless they think that, \Nthey won't go so far as to subscribe!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.68,0:04:50.68,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2.5\c&HF9FDFA&\3c&HE1309A&}Subscribe
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.68,0:04:52.68,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2.5\c&HE2319B&\3c&HF6CFE5&}Subscribed
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.68,0:04:55.41,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,So how do we win them over?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.41,0:04:56.56,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.56,0:04:58.19,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What kind of people do you like?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.19,0:04:59.32,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Masaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.32,0:05:00.19,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Other than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.19,0:05:02.43,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,The man I fell in love with...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.43,0:05:06.77,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,He always brought his lackeys as he\N strutted down the streets at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.11,0:05:13.75,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,But in private, he was a lonely man, \Ntoppling cigarette butts like dominoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.63,0:05:17.61,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What Tokage just said...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.93,0:05:19.42,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,She hit the nail on the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.42,0:05:20.25,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Where?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.25,0:05:22.62,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,In other words, to fall in love...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.62,0:05:25.44,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,The keyword here is "unexpected."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.44,0:05:27.01,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,So you mean like gap moe!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.01,0:05:28.20,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.20,0:05:31.14,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,We'll analyze the videos that \Nattract the most subscribers
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.70,0:05:35.48,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,and figure out the "gap" \Nthat people want from us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.66,0:05:37.48,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.33,0:05:39.39,Default,Live,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.39,0:05:41.73,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,The one that gained us the most subs...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.73,0:05:47.11,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs30\fnArial Black\an9\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\bord4\pos(311.5,13)}Makeover!!\N{\fs22\c&HE0F3E6&\3c&HE0F3E6&}Total Wardrobe Change\N{\c&HE0F3E6&}for a {\c&H255C18&\3c&H255C18&\fnGeorgia}Filthy Slob
Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.73,0:05:47.11,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs30\fnArial Black\an9\c&H2B2ACF&\3c&HEDEFEB&\bord2\pos(311.5,13)}Makeover!!\N{\fs22\c&H80D1E8&\3c&H2C6944&}Total Wardrobe Change\N{\c&HE0F3E6&}for a {\c&H26BF33&\3c&HEAEFEE&\fnGeorgia}Filthy Slob
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.07,0:05:44.63,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Tokage-san's wardrobe change?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.63,0:05:47.11,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,This video was fun, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.53,0:05:51.19,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,But it didn't really stand out that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.69,0:05:53.74,Flashback,Otomi,0,0,0,,Still, it's getting good numbers!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.13,0:05:58.38,Flashback,Masaki,0,0,0,,It's just a video of us drinking boba \Nand goofing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.38,0:06:00.25,Flashback,Otomi,0,0,0,,A ton of people left comments!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.25,0:06:03.25,Flashback,Otomi,0,0,0,,"I think I'll also grab some \Nboba tomorrow," it says!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.25,0:06:03.25,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(300,16)}Strawberry Milk\NI think I'll also grab some boba tomorrow!\N\NRin\NGotta say... just adorbs <3\N\NSatoru\NI love hearing the three of you talk
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.09,0:06:06.88,Flashback,Kikka,0,0,0,,We're seeing the birth of \NKikka the Influencer here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.35,0:06:10.43,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.43,0:06:11.64,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,228)\fs40\fnArial Black\bord4\shad2\move(322,261.5,284,261.5)\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HC7A8EF&}The Dessert Trending Now
Dialogue: 1,0:06:10.43,0:06:11.64,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,228)\fs40\fnArial Black\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H5E2B8A&\bord2\move(322,261.5,284,261.5)}The {\c&H8532E5&}Dessert Trending {\c&H4CF1E6&\3c&H276EBA&}Now
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.74,0:06:11.88,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,This video...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.72,0:06:13.18,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(234,1)\fnTimes New Roman\an7\c&HCD017D&\3c&HEEECEA&\bord2\shad2\4c&HAA4DC8&\pos(292,40)}This Plain Jane\N\N{\c&HE0EAF0&\3c&H3F2A8D&\4c&HA13ED1&}Can't Stop {\c&HF1E4EF&\3c&H9840C3&\4c&HB43FE1&}Talking About {\c&H9600B6&\3c&HEBAFF6&\4c&HAA41D8&}Fashion
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.88,0:06:13.18,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,And this one...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.49,0:06:16.01,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,They've all led to more subscribers!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.58,0:06:21.69,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I've got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.04,0:06:27.19,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,The audience from our shorts think MayoPan \Nis a group that only does weird stunts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.77,0:06:31.45,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,The gap that comes from that same MayoPan \Nbeing up-to-date on the latest trends—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.89,0:06:34.45,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,that's what our new viewers are after!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.44,0:06:40.54,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,The answer to step two is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.42,0:06:42.96,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(438,1)\fs40\bord3.5\fnArial Black\c&H7C23D2&\3c&H7C23D2&\pos(320,16)}MayoPan {\bord2.5}x {\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\bord3.5}Trends
Dialogue: 1,0:06:40.42,0:06:42.96,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(438,1)\fs40\bord1.5\fnArial Black\c&HD10EBD&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(320,16)}MayoPan {\c&HFDFDFA&\3c&H000000&}x {\c&H61C6F3&\3c&HFFFFFF&}Trends
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.89,0:06:43.21,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,MayoPan combined with trends!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.69,0:06:45.21,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,Eating the hot new gummies...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.21,0:06:47.21,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,Using them as cooking ingredients...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.49,0:06:49.47,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,With a good grasp on makeup and fashion!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.14,0:06:51.47,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.47,0:06:54.05,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,Now we've completed step two!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.82,0:06:57.47,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Or so I thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.47,0:06:58.81,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H4A4D4A&\pos(337.5,86)}Mayonaka Punch
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.47,0:06:58.81,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fs20\c&HF9EAEF&\3c&HCF52D5&\pos(498,178.5)}51k subscribers
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.81,0:07:01.14,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,but it's not working at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.19,0:07:05.54,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Masaki...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.70,0:07:09.64,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Y-Yay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.64,0:07:10.32,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.32,0:07:11.57,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Two?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.26,0:07:16.70,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,From here on, we're doing \Ntwo new videos every day!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.08,0:07:18.95,Default,Live,0,0,0,,{\i1}Two{\i0} new videos?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.80,0:07:22.46,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,Uploading two videos every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.82,0:07:26.71,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,This is how I'll bring us to the next phase!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.25,0:07:30.97,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,We need to hit at least 150k subs soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.97,0:07:34.72,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,or we'll never be able to get \Nto a million in six months!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.25,0:07:40.48,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,That's why... I need to step up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.67,0:07:44.98,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,This is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.24,0:07:47.48,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I just won't sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.81,0:07:50.92,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Just won't... sleep...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.53,0:07:54.64,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I don't... want to lose them again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.29,0:08:11.01,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Oh, no! The editing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.33,0:08:12.30,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.38,0:08:36.59,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H4A4D4A&\pos(393,136)}Get 1 mil!!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.83,0:08:37.20,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.20,0:08:38.62,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Did you do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.62,0:08:39.63,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Yep!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.63,0:08:43.52,Default,Live,0,0,0,,You fell asleep, so I took care of the lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.52,0:08:45.29,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Sorry for falling asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.29,0:08:47.90,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Well? Aren't I amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.90,0:08:50.03,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Just call me an editing master!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.03,0:08:50.81,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.81,0:08:54.09,Default,Live,0,0,0,,From now on, I can take over \Nediting whenever you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.09,0:08:57.51,Default,Live,0,0,0,,So when you need my help, \Nfeel free to ask anytime!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.51,0:09:02.43,Default,Live,0,0,0,,After all, you and I make a great pair \Nthat can't be separated!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.43,0:09:03.27,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Get real!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.27,0:09:04.18,Default,Live,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.18,0:09:06.69,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Editing's not that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.69,0:09:09.41,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,You should be using way more \Nsound effects and BGMs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.10,0:09:09.07,DefaultItalicsTop,Live,0,0,0,,Okay, let's dig in!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.41,0:09:12.40,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,And you can trim a lot more \Ndead space between conversations!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.69,0:09:12.32,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord1\fs20\fnTimes New Roman\pos(327.5,179)}Taste Test
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.40,0:09:15.92,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Be more ruthless, and keep only the\N parts that the viewers want to see!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.03,0:09:18.82,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Now I need to redo everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.82,0:09:20.33,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,Snap!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.82,0:09:20.33,DefaultTop,Masaki,0,0,0,,Man, I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.46,0:09:24.01,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,Okay, let's dig in!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.12,0:09:26.75,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord1\fs20\fnTimes New Roman\pos(320,193.5)}Taste Test
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.94,0:09:27.72,DefaultItalics,Tokage,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.72,0:09:30.29,DefaultItalics,Tokage,0,0,0,,Check out Fu drooling all over herself!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.29,0:09:31.45,DefaultItalics,Fu,0,0,0,,A-Am not!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.45,0:09:32.46,DefaultItalics,Ichiko,0,0,0,,She's hiding it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.46,0:09:33.41,DefaultItalics,Fu,0,0,0,,Nuh-uh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.41,0:09:35.30,DefaultItalics,Tokage,0,0,0,,Ichiko, pat her down!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.30,0:09:36.38,DefaultItalics,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Yes, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.38,0:09:38.10,DefaultItalics,Fu,0,0,0,,Stop it! I'll die of shame!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.10,0:09:39.71,DefaultItalics,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.39,0:09:43.78,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.52,0:09:46.22,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,So good!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.77,0:09:49.19,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Take this part...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.63,0:09:50.81,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,and do this...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.06,0:09:53.44,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,Okay, let's dig in!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.47,0:09:56.32,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,So good!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.32,0:10:00.07,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,This, this, this, and this can all go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.86,0:10:03.71,Default,Live,0,0,0,,H-Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.71,0:10:04.54,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.98,0:10:10.42,Default,Live,0,0,0,,F-Frankly speaking, there's no way \Nyou can handle this many videos by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.42,0:10:11.88,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Right? So why don't we...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.88,0:10:13.67,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Not a friggin' chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.95,0:10:16.34,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,You think I can have you \Ntake over after seeing {\i1}this?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.34,0:10:18.34,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Don't bother! I'll do it all myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.85,0:10:21.35,Default,Group,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.35,0:10:24.45,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Shoot {\i1}three{\i0} videos every day?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.45,0:10:26.62,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,It's to save Banpai Manor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.40,0:10:29.60,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Let me just go ahead and say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.06,0:10:31.73,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,You're bananas.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.73,0:10:32.98,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Don't complain!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.98,0:10:37.24,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs30\c&H4A4D4A&\pos(199,33)}Mayonaka Punch
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.98,0:10:37.24,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fs20\c&HF9EAEF&\3c&HCF52D5&\pos(444,176)}52k subscribers
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.63,0:10:38.74,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.25,0:10:41.23,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Why aren't we gaining any subs?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.83,0:10:43.95,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,All this hard work, for nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.87,0:10:53.31,DefaultTop,Live,0,0,0,,We don't need that part!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.31,0:10:54.72,DefaultTop,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Why not?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.72,0:10:56.70,DefaultTop,Live,0,0,0,,We need to trim it down a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.70,0:10:57.57,DefaultTop,Tokage,0,0,0,,Who was that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.57,0:10:59.10,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,They're still awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.57,0:11:00.14,DefaultTop,Tokage,0,0,0,,Who stuffed green chilies in my nostrils?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.14,0:11:01.12,DefaultTop,Live,0,0,0,,That should wake you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.12,0:11:02.51,DefaultTop,Ichiko,0,0,0,,It's a good luck charm!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.80,0:11:04.43,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,God, I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.94,0:11:08.88,DefaultItalics,Outlaw,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.88,0:11:12.44,DefaultItalics,Outlaw,0,0,0,,The Outside Kids Anything Goes \NExposé Livestream Party!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.44,0:11:14.82,DefaultItalics,Outlaw,0,0,0,,About time we wrap things up, capisce?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.82,0:11:15.79,DefaultItalics,Sidebrah,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.79,0:11:17.30,DefaultItalics,Sidebrah,0,0,0,,You're really gonna end it like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.30,0:11:18.57,DefaultItalics,Sidebrah,0,0,0,,That friggin' sucked!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.57,0:11:19.65,DefaultItalics,Sidebrah,0,0,0,,Seriously, "capisce"?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.65,0:11:21.82,DefaultItalics,Fu,0,0,0,,They're really foul-mouthed...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.82,0:11:23.20,DefaultItalics,Fu,0,0,0,,And yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.07,0:11:27.20,DefaultItalics,Fu,0,0,0,,How despicable! Don't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.20,0:11:30.64,DefaultItalics,Sidebrah,0,0,0,,Hey, my loyal minions watching out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.64,0:11:32.09,DefaultItalics,Sidebrah,0,0,0,,You'll tune in next time, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.09,0:11:32.89,DefaultItalics,Fu,0,0,0,,I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.89,0:11:35.96,DefaultItalics,Outlaw,0,0,0,,And of course you'll listen to our \Nnew song dropping next week, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.96,0:11:37.46,DefaultItalics,Fu,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.46,0:11:38.71,DefaultItalics,Sidebrah,0,0,0,,All righty then!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.71,0:11:41.63,DefaultItalics,Group,0,0,0,,Signing off, we're the Outside Kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.63,0:11:44.94,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,And I'm an Outside Girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.94,0:11:46.00,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What's that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.11,0:11:52.32,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Fu, that's what you're into? News to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.32,0:11:54.14,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Y-Y-You're mistaken!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.14,0:11:59.37,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,I just, um, thought I could learn a lot \Nby watching some top streamers!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.37,0:12:01.21,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,So, um, well... That is...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.21,0:12:02.57,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Why don't you come down?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.57,0:12:03.92,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,You'll catch a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.92,0:12:05.49,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.19,0:12:09.56,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Um, will you tell Live-sama and the others...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.56,0:12:10.50,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,My lips are sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.16,0:12:12.73,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,That's a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.52,0:12:18.25,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Have I been mistaken somehow all along?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.91,0:12:20.36,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Masaki-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.04,0:12:21.97,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.97,0:12:25.39,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Are you subbed to the Outside Kids channel?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.39,0:12:27.22,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.22,0:12:29.09,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,I gave them my very first.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.09,0:12:29.72,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.11,0:12:38.88,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Okay, so why did you decide to subscribe?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.25,0:12:41.47,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,W-W-W-Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.47,0:12:43.62,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Um, um, I mean, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.62,0:12:44.57,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.03,0:12:51.58,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Because those two were adorbs, perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.97,0:12:53.12,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Adorbs?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.12,0:12:53.97,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.97,0:12:58.60,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,So I wanted to watch more of them \Nand show my support.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.60,0:13:00.74,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,That's why I subscribed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.94,0:13:03.80,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Adorbs... Their blood...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.89,0:13:06.11,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.11,0:13:09.01,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What exactly about them do you find "adorbs"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.88,0:13:11.62,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,That's, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.62,0:13:12.68,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Is it their gap?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.68,0:13:13.93,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,It is, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.93,0:13:16.45,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,You thought they were scary, \Nbut they ended up being nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.45,0:13:19.49,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,That's a part of it, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.49,0:13:22.19,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,But their relationship is what's adorbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.19,0:13:23.29,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.29,0:13:26.52,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,As they talk to each other, \Nit slips out sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.52,0:13:29.28,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Their true selves, \Nnot the personas they've built!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.28,0:13:32.62,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,The moment you get a peek, it's like...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.91,0:13:36.28,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.24,0:13:40.39,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,I'm out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.66,0:13:46.15,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Adorbs...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.53,0:13:50.76,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,Adorbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.09,0:13:56.27,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,When Hype-Sis blew up, \Na lot of comments said the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.27,0:13:59.27,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs20\pos(338.5,128)\c&H636663&}Hyped-Up Sisters Z{channel name}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.27,0:13:59.27,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fs16\3c&HD35FCF&\pos(389,222.5)}325k subscribers
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.27,0:13:59.27,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fs16\pos(224.5,264)\c&HCBB3B2&\3c&HEDE5E4&}Latest             Popular            {\3c&HD53192&\c&HECBCE1&}Oldest
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.27,0:14:02.77,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord4\shad1.5\fs30\fnArial Black\pos(402,21.5)\c&HB243BF&\3c&HB243BF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}It's Boba Time!!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:01.27,0:14:02.77,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fs30\fnArial Black\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&HDE2377&\pos(402,21.5)}It's {\c&H9513E3&}B{\c&H3434D6&}o{\c&H33BAE2&}b{\c&H5220D5&}a {\c&H8A852A&}Ti{\c&H549B2B&}me{\c&H3520E1&}!!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.27,0:14:02.77,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs22\c&H646260&\pos(212.5,279.5)}Letting Loose with a Boba Party
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.45,0:14:04.25,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,Masakichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.25,0:14:05.06,DefaultItalics,Kikka,0,0,0,,Kicchomu!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.06,0:14:05.86,DefaultItalics,Otomi,0,0,0,,Otomin!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.86,0:14:07.80,DefaultItalics,Group,0,0,0,,We are Hype-Sis—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.51,0:14:10.61,DefaultItalics,Otomi,0,0,0,,Whoa, Masakichi's looks good!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.61,0:14:11.23,DefaultItalics,Otomi,0,0,0,,Lemme try some!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.23,0:14:12.42,DefaultItalics,Kikka,0,0,0,,You're right! Let me have some, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.42,0:14:13.72,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,What? Let me think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.72,0:14:15.45,DefaultItalics,Kikka,0,0,0,,Huh? What's the big deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.45,0:14:16.98,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,S-So young...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.98,0:14:17.47,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.47,0:14:19.17,DefaultItalics,Kikka,0,0,0,,Time for a sip!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.93,0:14:36.14,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(325,13.5)\fad(0,150)}Strawberry Milk\NI think I'll also grab some boba tomorrow!\N\NRin\NGotta say... just adorbs <3\N\NSatoru\NI love hearing the three of you talk\N\NPudding Parfait\NReally dig the laid-back vibes\N\NHedgehog Girl\NNow I want some boba!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.14,0:14:38.12,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(325,13.5)\fad(150,150)}Hedgehog Girl\NNow I want some boba!\N\NEiko Fan\NI've totally drank too fast and choked on\Nthe pearls too lolol\NClassic milk tea's fine but now I'm curious \Nabout the mango one so I'll try it next time\N\NAnnie\NYou all get along so well~ I'm here for it.\N\NIt's Me Hana\NSo cute seeing Kicchomu always mess up,\NMasakichi snark at her, and Otomin sitting\Nthere with a smile. I could watch it all day.\N\Nyufu\Nliterally laughed out loud around 7:40 lmao
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.12,0:14:40.12,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(325,13.5)\fad(150,150)}It's Me Hana\NSo cute seeing Kicchomu always mess up,\NMasakichi snark at her, and Otomin sitting\Nthere with a smile. I could watch it all day.\N\Nyufu\Nliterally laughed out loud around 7:40 lmao\N\Nnanami\Ni bet it's always a fun time with you three\N\NBury Me in Whipped Cream\NLove that you're just a bunch of friends\Nwho laugh at stupid stuff\N\NTangerine\NI enjoyed getting a glimpse into the daily\Nlives of Hype-Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.12,0:14:42.10,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(325,13.5)\fad(150,150)}Tangerine\NI enjoyed getting a glimpse into the daily\Nlives of Hype-Sis!\N\NLemon Beer\NLove that Kikka looks so stoic but acts\Nso dumb\N\NEmperor Penguin\NGirl on the left is cute.\N\Nanna\NI was like "it's boba!" at the thumbnail,\Nand I wanted to watch while drinking some,\Nso I grabbed some by the station on my\Nway home!\N\NThrilling Chondroitin\NThis video's gonna go big... (who?)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.10,0:14:43.69,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(325,13.5)\fad(150,0)}anna\NI was like "it's boba!" at the thumbnail,\Nand I wanted to watch while drinking some,\Nso I grabbed some by the station on my\Nway home!\N\NThrilling Chondroitin\NThis video's gonna go big... (who?)\N\NCocoa\N10 min went by in a flash. Way too funny.\N\NPudding Parfait\NYou're such good friends, way too\Nadorbs!!!!!\N\NAnkoro Mochi\NI live in the middle of nowhere, so they\Ndon't have boba places here ;w;\NSo jealous, must be nice.\NI'll just have to make do with this video\Ninstead.
