Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.28,0:14:52.44,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,Good morning from the dead of night!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.44,0:14:53.33,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,Live here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.33,0:14:54.28,DefaultItalics,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Ichiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.28,0:14:54.81,DefaultItalics,Fu,0,0,0,,Fu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.81,0:14:56.50,DefaultItalics,Tokage,0,0,0,,Tokage!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.50,0:15:00.21,DefaultItalics,Ichiko,0,0,0,,For today's video, we're under de-TEN-sion \Nuntil we eat all these giant macarons!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.21,0:15:01.29,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,There are more than ten, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.29,0:15:02.21,DefaultItalics,Ichiko,0,0,0,,So picky!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.53,0:15:05.14,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,Okay, let's dig in!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.17,0:15:07.80,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord1\fs20\fnTimes New Roman\pos(320,193.5)}Taste Test
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.96,0:15:08.72,DefaultItalics,Tokage,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.72,0:15:11.33,DefaultItalics,Tokage,0,0,0,,Check out Fu drooling all over herself!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.33,0:15:12.43,DefaultItalics,Fu,0,0,0,,A-Am not!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.04,0:15:23.48,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.26,0:15:26.34,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,So good!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.53,0:15:29.32,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,How stupid.
