Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.59,0:15:39.37,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,A summer wardrobe for Tokage, our filthy slob!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.37,0:15:40.08,DefaultItalics,Tokage,0,0,0,,Yay—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.08,0:15:43.58,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\q2\fsp50\fs40\bord4\c&HFAFFFB&\3c&HFAFFFB&\pos(344,235)}SHAWL
Dialogue: 1,0:15:41.08,0:15:43.58,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\q2\fsp50\fs40\bord3\c&HFAFFFB&\3c&HE691F5&\pos(344,235)}SHAWL
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.08,0:15:43.58,DefaultItalicsTop,Tokage,0,0,0,,S-H-A-W-L...
