Dialogue: 1,0:15:43.58,0:15:45.71,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fnTimes New Roman\fs40\c&H82B6D6&\pos(444.5,270)}Shawl
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.20,0:15:45.71,DefaultItalicsTop,Tokage,0,0,0,,Shawl!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.71,0:15:47.21,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs30\fnTimes New Roman\pos(295.5,246)\c&H347EC3&\3c&HB862D5&\bord3}She turned out to like it {\c&H5A19D5&}<3
Dialogue: 1,0:15:45.71,0:15:47.21,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs30\fnTimes New Roman\pos(295.5,246)\c&H9CCAE5&\3c&H724D97&\bord1}She turned out to like it {\c&H5A19D5&}<3
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.71,0:15:47.37,DefaultItalicsTop,Live,0,0,0,,That looks great on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.37,0:15:48.64,DefaultItalics,Fu,0,0,0,,This is this year's—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.64,0:15:50.24,DefaultItalics,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I wanna try it on, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.24,0:15:50.84,DefaultItalicsTop,Fu,0,0,0,,Tre—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.24,0:15:54.86,DefaultItalics,Tokage,0,0,0,,Ichiko, these clothes \Naren't for little kids to wear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.86,0:15:55.82,DefaultItalicsTop,Fu,0,0,0,,Trend—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.22,0:15:57.20,DefaultItalics,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I want to be element, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.20,0:15:58.13,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,You mean "elegant."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.13,0:15:59.22,DefaultItalics,Fu,0,0,0,,Trend!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.60,0:16:00.85,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs40\fnArial Black\bord4\shad2\pos(322,261.5)\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HC7A8EF&}The Dessert Trending Now
Dialogue: 1,0:15:59.60,0:16:00.85,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs40\fnArial Black\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H5E2B8A&\bord2\pos(322,261.5)}The {\c&H8532E5&}Dessert Trending {\c&H4CF1E6&\3c&H276EBA&}Now
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.85,0:16:02.60,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs40\fnArial Black\pos(305,197)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord3}Don't make a mess!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:00.85,0:16:02.60,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs40\fnArial Black\pos(305,197)\c&H240AB1&\bord1.5}Don't make a mess!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.32,0:16:02.60,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,This one...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.60,0:16:03.60,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\an7\c&HCD017D&\3c&HEEECEA&\bord2\shad2\4c&HAA4DC8&\pos(292,40)}This Plain Jane\N\N{\c&HE0EAF0&\3c&H3F2A8D&\4c&HA13ED1&}Can't Stop {\c&HF1E4EF&\3c&H9840C3&\4c&HB43FE1&}Talking About {\c&H9600B6&\3c&HEBAFF6&\4c&HAA41D8&}Fashion
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.92,0:16:05.11,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,And this one...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.11,0:16:06.36,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H595C59&\frz13.82\pos(26.5,92.5)}*LIVING IT UP* Spending Our Video Earnings on Trendy Items!!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.11,0:16:06.36,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an9\c&HE5E9EB&\bord3\frz13.82\3c&HD856D0&\pos(363,260.5)}860k views   {\c&HA68D91&\bord0}2 weeks ago
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.78,0:16:07.91,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,And this...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.93,0:16:12.51,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Aw, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.26,0:16:20.65,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,There! And over here... there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.65,0:16:22.26,Default,Live,0,0,0,,No, that's wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.26,0:16:24.33,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Then... like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.33,0:16:25.29,Default,Group,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.29,0:16:28.01,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I-I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.80,0:16:31.42,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,You let your guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.42,0:16:33.55,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,A taste of your own wake-up call!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.55,0:16:36.51,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,A maiden's nose is delicate!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.96,0:16:38.91,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Fu! Grab Tokage!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.91,0:16:39.52,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.00,0:16:42.77,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Stop, Tokage!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.53,0:16:48.52,Default,Live,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.71,0:16:51.08,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.99,0:16:54.28,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I've realized something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.28,0:16:55.15,Default,Live,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.11,0:16:59.63,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,The reason people subscribe to our channel...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.27,0:17:01.26,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,It's your...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.26,0:17:02.36,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.84,0:17:09.67,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,It's your chemistry and your \Ntrue selves that they're into.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.38,0:17:12.79,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I thought I knew that already.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.17,0:17:18.06,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,But I panicked all by myself about \Ntrying to quickly gain subscribers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.06,0:17:20.74,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,And soon, I lost sight of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.74,0:17:23.18,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I came up with strategies \Nbased around gaps and trends,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.94,0:17:26.81,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,but in the end, I was erasing \Nall of your best parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.12,0:17:31.32,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,No wonder our channel wasn't growing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.57,0:17:36.23,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Those so-called meaningless and pointless bits,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.23,0:17:42.33,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,where you laughed, got angry, and worried \Nwhile getting along together as friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.33,0:17:44.58,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Those were MayoPan's strengths this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.47,0:17:48.83,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I'm always like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.54,0:17:51.23,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,When I was with Hype-Sis,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.23,0:17:53.55,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I forged on ahead by myself \Nbecause we weren't growing
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.55,0:17:56.04,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,and ruined our friendship in the process.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.04,0:17:58.65,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,It's no surprise that I ended up \Ngetting kicked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.98,0:18:01.39,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I'm so stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.69,0:18:02.28,Default,Live,0,0,0,,That's not—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.28,0:18:03.80,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,So I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.28,0:18:06.11,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,And that's why starting tomorrow—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.11,0:18:07.12,Default,Live,0,0,0,,There you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.12,0:18:09.44,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Panicking and going off all by yourself again!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.63,0:18:13.44,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I've said this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.78,0:18:17.10,Default,Live,0,0,0,,You've got me to help you now, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.10,0:18:18.57,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I'm here, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.57,0:18:20.50,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,So you figured it out, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.50,0:18:22.00,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.08,0:18:24.30,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.70,0:18:27.64,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Starting now, let's all work together!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.29,0:18:32.33,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Instead of panicking by yourself, \Nwe can all panic together!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.33,0:18:33.46,Default,Live,0,0,0,,And, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.46,0:18:36.46,Default,Live,0,0,0,,We tried editing this one more time as a group.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.22,0:18:40.61,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I put in all sorts of text!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.61,0:18:42.61,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,You messed up a ton of kanji, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.61,0:18:44.72,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,I-I handled the BGMs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.61,0:18:49.73,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,You were working on this the whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.19,0:18:52.25,Default,Live,0,0,0,,We're still pretty bad at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.61,0:18:56.69,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Masaki, lean on us a little more from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.69,0:18:58.86,Default,Live,0,0,0,,We'll be depending on you as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.86,0:19:01.36,Default,Live,0,0,0,,It's not MayoPan without all of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.95,0:19:03.12,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.11,0:19:15.14,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.14,0:19:21.59,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,In that case, without further ado...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.92,0:19:25.14,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Can we shoot a video?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.18,0:19:31.33,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,And so, let's get started!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.33,0:19:33.65,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,And so, what? Give us a rundown!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.65,0:19:35.88,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,"Talking It Out in the Bath!"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.88,0:19:36.92,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.92,0:19:39.33,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What's important is your chemistry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.33,0:19:42.57,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Forget about clothes, makeup, \Nideas, and the camera,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.57,0:19:44.41,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,and show us all your true selves!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.67,0:19:47.04,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,I already took a bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.04,0:19:49.04,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,You're totally doing this for the numbers!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.04,0:19:51.72,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Numbers{\i0} are what we need!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.72,0:19:52.93,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Besides, Ichiko...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.93,0:19:56.79,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,You'll be covered with an on-screen strawberry \Nfrom start to finish, so don't sweat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.79,0:19:59.44,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Why do you have to cover {\i1}me{\i0} up?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.44,0:20:01.58,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,So that our channel doesn't get banned!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.58,0:20:03.01,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I'm a hundred and ten!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.01,0:20:03.84,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.84,0:20:05.37,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,You want to save Banpai Manor, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.37,0:20:08.30,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Give it up and pretend you're wearing \Nthat strawberry costume you wanted!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.93,0:20:09.73,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,C'mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.73,0:20:11.47,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Quit your yapping and let's get filming!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.47,0:20:13.19,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Okay! Ready, start!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.19,0:20:15.74,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Good morning from the dead of night!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.74,0:20:18.27,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Mayonaka Punch! Live here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.27,0:20:21.54,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Today's video is "Talking It Out in the Bath!"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.54,0:20:24.29,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Hold on. We've been living \Ntogether for ages already.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.29,0:20:26.95,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,There's nothing for us to talk about anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.82,0:20:26.95,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(405,1)\bord2\fnComic Sans MS\c&H777A77&\3c&HFCFFFC&}I have a funny story for you
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.95,0:20:28.83,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.83,0:20:30.74,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Then I'll start...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.74,0:20:33.58,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I have something funny we can talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.50,0:20:33.58,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs30\fad(405,1)\bord2\fnComic Sans MS\c&H5B5E5B&\3c&HFCFFFC&\pos(393,102.5)}Fu loves the Outside Kids!!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.22,0:20:34.85,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Wait—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.85,0:20:37.84,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Fu's a huge fan of the Outside Kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.84,0:20:39.14,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I've heard of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.14,0:20:41.50,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,The NewTubers who wear shampoo hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.50,0:20:45.10,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Oh, is that why you love taking baths?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.10,0:20:50.97,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,What do you see in that pair of phony, \Nempty-headed bell peppers, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.48,0:20:55.98,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,D-Don't make fun of the Outside Kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.16,0:21:08.65,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Hell yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.16,0:21:11.04,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,104)\c&H4A4D4A&\pos(228,43)}Mayonaka Punch
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.16,0:21:11.08,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,144)\bord2\fs20\c&HF9EAEF&\3c&HCF52D5&\pos(388.5,195)}101k subscribers
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.65,0:21:11.31,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I guess everyone got a good \Ntaste of MayoPan's chemistry!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.95,0:21:13.79,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(236,1)\bord4\shad1\fnArial Black\pos(320,108.5)\c&H61C7D8&\3c&H61C7D8&\4c&H61C7D8&}Girls' Talk in the Bath
Dialogue: 1,0:21:10.95,0:21:13.79,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(236,1)\bord2.5\fnArial Black\pos(320,108.5)\c&HCC69BE&\3c&HEBEAE5&}Girls' Talk in the Bath
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.31,0:21:12.28,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.28,0:21:14.37,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,It's totally just because we were naked!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.37,0:21:16.33,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Are you really okay with such cheap tactics?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.33,0:21:20.86,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Well, be that as it may, now we can \Ngo back to one video per day.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.86,0:21:22.03,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Wait a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.03,0:21:23.68,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,We should keep putting out three—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.68,0:21:25.17,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Masaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.31,0:21:28.04,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Well, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.04,0:21:31.06,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I want to shoot plenty of \Nyour pointless moments.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.36,0:21:34.82,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,The goal for step two was \N100k subscribers, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.82,0:21:36.33,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,So we can finally move on!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.33,0:21:37.06,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.34,0:21:39.31,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Step three is...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.31,0:21:41.07,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Collabs with big names.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.36,0:21:42.57,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Collabs?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.57,0:21:46.56,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I took a long shot and sent out messages \Nto several people asking for a collab.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.03,0:21:49.20,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.20,0:21:50.45,Default,Live,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.45,0:21:53.68,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,An invitation to a NewTuber festival?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.45,0:21:54.95,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(340,15.5)\c&H515552&\3c&HFBFEFB&}TSUMA-shi\N\N{\c&H737373&\3c&HF5E6E2&}To the members of Mayonaka Punch\N\NHello. My apologies for the\Nunsolicited message.\NMy name is TSUMA-shi,\Nand I post videos on NewTube.\NI'm writing to you today to\Ndiscuss a business opportunity.\N\NI will be hosting a NewTuber festival\Nevent (TSUMA FES Extreme),\Nand currently, I'm reaching out\Nto a number of content creators to...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.93,0:22:16.43,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(195,137)\fs16\fnComic Sans MS\an7\c&H141719&\pos(280.5,6.5)}Fu\NSent you a sticker
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.93,0:22:16.43,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(195,137)\fs16\fnComic Sans MS\c&HFEF7EA&\3c&HDF786C&\bord1.5\blur1\pos(448.5,60.5)}Goodnight
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.37,0:23:26.49,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Wh-Whoa! No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.05,0:23:26.67,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(188,1)\fnArial Black\c&HFFFFFF&\bord3\pos(134.5,14)\3c&HFFFFFF&}TSUMA-shi
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.05,0:23:26.67,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(188,1)\fnArial Black\c&H953AF3&\bord1.5\pos(134.5,14)}T{\c&HFFFFFF&}SUMA-shi
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.05,0:23:26.67,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(188,1)\fnArial Black\an7\c&HFDFCFF&\4c&H9C41E9&\shad2\pos(362.5,27)}Legendary streamer\Nknown as the {\c&H9C41E9&\bord2.5\3c&HFDFCFF&}Stream God
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.49,0:23:27.41,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,TSUMA-shi himself?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.41,0:23:28.91,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Masaki-san, you had a fave as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.91,0:23:29.37,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Oh, Fu!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.37,0:23:30.26,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Look, it's the Outside Kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.26,0:23:30.77,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.77,0:23:33.18,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,But behind them is... TSUMA-shi in the flesh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.73,0:23:37.98,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Next time: "Starring in TSUMA FES Extreme!"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.26,0:23:37.72,Signs_EpTitle,Sign,0,0,0,,{\3c&H3C4A48&}Starring in TSUMA FES Extreme!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.98,0:23:39.98,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,I-I've got an extreme case of the nerves!
